<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Heavy Industry wins $230 mln deal in China.</title>
<headline>Korea Heavy Industry wins $230 mln deal in China.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's state-backed Korea Heavy Industries and Construction Co Ltd won a $230 million deal to build a cement plant in China's Shandong Province, the company said on Monday.</p>
</text>
